# Changelog

## 0.5.0

- Fixed four primary contracts: Evidence Pack, Simulation Package, Workload Manifest, and Simulation Receipt.
- Added evidence-backed variable calibration: observed range, mean/stddev, and empirical sampling.
- Added explicit missing-evidence policies.
- Added data-quality and calibration reports to every Receipt.
- Added workload run-range enforcement and workload results.
- Added calibrated and sparse versions of the automation example.
- Retained v0.4.0 automation routing and v0.3.0 safety-net behavior.
